---
import { MILESTONES } from '../../data/milestones';
import PunchCard from '../PunchCard.astro';
import { type Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}

const { locale = 'es' } = Astro.props;
const milestone = MILESTONES[7];
---

<section 
  id="scene-8" 
  class="scene" 
  data-scene="eniac" 
  data-year={milestone.year}
  data-pi-value={milestone.precisionValue}
  data-theme={milestone.theme}
  data-scene-title={milestone.title[locale]}
>
  <div class="stage">
    <!-- Narrative Center (Uncollapsible, balanced typography) -->
    <div class="narrative">
      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.05-0.38">
        <span class="scene-kicker">08 // MADRAS Y CAMBRIDGE, 1914 · RAMANUJAN</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">El Sueño de Namagiri</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'Srinivasa Ramanujan afirmaba que la diosa Namagiri escribía fórmulas en su lengua mientras dormía. Entre ellas, una serie infinita con el factor 2√2/9801 que destroza la lentitud: con un solo paso de cálculo clava 8 decimales exactos de golpe.'
            : 'Srinivasa Ramanujan declared the goddess Namagiri inscribed equations upon his tongue in dreams. Among them was an infinite series with prefactor 2√2/9801 that obliterated mathematical slowness: in a single step, it nails 8 exact decimals.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.42-0.80">
        <span class="scene-kicker">08 // ABERDEEN, 1949 · EL AMANECER DEL SILICIO</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">ENIAC: 70 Horas para 2,037 Dígitos</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'En 1949, John von Neumann introdujo a π dentro de una bestia de 30 toneladas y 17,468 tubos de vacío. Durante el fin de semana del 4 de julio, las tarjetas perforadas devoraron 2,037 decimales en 70 horas continuas, pulverizando 4,000 años de aritmética humana.'
            : 'In 1949, John von Neumann fed π into a 30-ton colossus of 17,468 vacuum tubes. Over the July 4th weekend, 80-column punch cards chewed out 2,037 exact decimals in 70 continuous hours, pulverizing four millennia of human labor.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beat beat-climax" data-beat="0.84-0.98">
        <blockquote class="eniac-quote">
          <p>«El cálculo manual había muerto. La era del silicio abría las compuertas del infinito.»</p>
          <cite>— George Reitwiesner &amp; John von Neumann (1949)</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Dual Ramanujan / ENIAC PunchCard Rig -->
    <div class="dual-tech-stage">
      <PunchCard />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .scene {
    height: 380vh;
    position: relative;
    --p: 0;
  }

  .stage {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #0d1a12 0%, #050a07 100%);
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  /* Uncollapsible Narrative Box */
  .narrative {
    position: absolute;
    top: 9vh;
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: min(90vw, 740px) !important;
    margin: 0 auto !important;
    text-align: center !important;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .beat {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translate3d(0, 16px, 0);
    transition: opacity 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 100% !important;
  }

  .beat.is-active {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .scene-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #33ff33;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .scene-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.8vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
  }

  .beat-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.8vw, 1.12rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
  }

  .eniac-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.8vw, 1.9rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: #33ff33;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(51, 255, 51, 0.5);
  }

  .eniac-quote cite {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-style: normal;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    margin-top: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .dual-tech-stage {
    margin-top: 18vh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 2;
  }
</style>
